A000568 via divisor profiles
========================================================================
Arithmetic delegation:
  odd-cycle filter from tournament Burnside
  gcd(a,b) = sum_{d|a,b} phi(d)
  state = odd-divisor profile S_d instead of pairwise gcd loops

